SUMMARY:Momo Rodriguez Halloween Show
LOCATION:The Stand Up Comedy Club\, Bellflower
DESCRIPTION:This Halloween\, the scariest thing in the room might be how ha
 
rd you're laughing. Momo Rodriguez is haunting The Stand Up Comedy Club wit
 
h a killer night of comedy\, surprise guest comedians\, and enough chaos to
 
 wake the dead. You've seen Momo as Steve on FX's Mayans M.C. and recurring
 
 on NBC's Lopez vs. Lopez---plus\, he produced George Lopez's Netflix speci
 
al We'll Do It for Half. And because apparently laughter isn't enough free 
 
stuff\, the first 50 people through the door get a raffle ticket for prizes
 
! Costumes encouraged. Laughing mandatory. Possession... case by case. Snat
 
ch your tickets before this Halloween show disappears into the night! *****
 
************************************* SCAM ALERT---IMPORTANT TICKET INFORMA
 
